OL,3,GNEWSA'Disgraceful' delays to bus
OL,4,Astation revamp
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents and business owners in a town
OL,7,Fhave said they are "disgusted" by
OL,8,Fdelays to a #2.5m bus station revamp.
OL,10,FDave Watson, who runs the bus station
OL,11,Fshop in Stanley, said he was losing
OL,12,F#400 a day due to the ongoing work as
OL,13,Fhe claims it makes his shop look
OL,14,Fclosed.
OL,16,FResident Vicki Lamey said locals had
OL,17,Fnot had an apology for the delays or an
OL,18,Fupdate on when work will be completed.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
